<title>TURKEY: Turk importers say detained U.S. wheat allowed in.</title>
<headline>Turk importers say detained U.S. wheat allowed in.</headline>
<dateline>ANKARA 1996-11-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Turkish wheat importers, whose cargoes of U.S. milling wheat have been held up at ports by the government for two weeks on grounds they might contain ergot fungus, said on Friday they were allowed to bring the cargoes into the country following the approval of health clearances.</p>
</text>
